Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:02.66,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}對輕咬示好的小貓們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:08.48,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我們由此相視而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:14.65,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我們永遠如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.83,0:02:17.68,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}該是多麼平靜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:20.20,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是愛意襲來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:24.01,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越發急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:26.78,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要選誰呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:27.28,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}「要選誰呢？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:30.08,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&2222CC&\blur4}就選你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:32.79,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&773333&\blur4}「選誰都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:33.08,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}「選誰都行？」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:35.80,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&443333&\blur4}就非你不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.34,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\3c&A777CA&\fad(120,120)\an9\t(400,700,\3c&999944&)}如果可以的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.61,0:02:41.00,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\blur4\3c&A777CA&}能像小貓輕咬般你儂我儂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:46.04,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\an9\3c&A777CA&\blur4}這麼直到永遠就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:49.95,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&A777CA&\t(500,2400,\3c&95B990&)}倘若我們認真起來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:52.59,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&A9A954&\blur4\t(300,2000,\3c&C777C3&)}心痛是在所難免的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:53.94,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&D777C3&\blur4\t(300,1200,\3c&579BE3&)}更不用說會傷害到彼此
